==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Wormadam}} in its {{form|Wormadam|Plant Cloak}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Wormadam|49}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*'''Leaf Cutter''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Wormadam|3}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

